title: Extensions' views are dragged into the side panel as tabs and out again onto the canvas, and each page keeps what it holds
folders: rust-small
extensions: webview-extension, views-extension
limit: 150
forbid-log: WARN.*script
expect-log: script: tree qa\.items: > Fruits / v Vegetables /   carrot /   leek / Read me
expect-file: rust-small/qa-pages.txt :: chat holds 3 clicks and "kept across moves" after 1 load\(s\)
expect-file: rust-small/qa-pages.txt :: pad holds 1 clicks and "" after 1 load\(s\)
expect-file: ..\data\prefs.json :: "docked": \[\s*"view:qa.pad"\s*\]

wait 3000
right qa.chat
wait 2500
page window.qa.more()
page window.qa.more()
page window.qa.write('kept across moves')
wait 400
mark a-chat-floating
wait 500
ui drag 1680 98 250 420
wait 1500
mark b-chat-docked-by-a-drag
wait 500
right qa.pad
wait 2500
ui drag 1680 98 64 62
wait 1500
mark c-pad-docked-before-chat
wait 500
page window.qa.more()
ui click 190 62
wait 1200
mark d-back-to-the-chat-tab
wait 500
page window.qa.more()
press ctrl+b
wait 900
mark e-panel-hidden
wait 400
press ctrl+b
wait 900
mark f-panel-shown-again
wait 400
ui drag 446 500 646 500
wait 900
mark g-panel-wider
wait 400
ui click 1545 20
wait 700
ui click 1500 256
wait 1200
mark h-panel-on-the-right-under-the-menu
wait 400
ui click 1500 226
wait 900
press escape
wait 600
ui drag 190 62 900 300
wait 1500
mark i-chat-floats-again
wait 500
page window.qa.report()
wait 1200
ui click 1213 267
wait 1200
mark j-chat-docked-from-its-card
wait 500
move qa.chat float
wait 1200
ui right 1680 62
wait 900
mark k-dock-from-the-bar-menu
wait 400
ui click 1568 114
wait 2500
tree report
mark l-tree-docked
wait 500
ui right 190 62
wait 900
mark m-float-from-the-tab-menu
wait 400
ui click 285 83
wait 1500
mark n-tree-floats-pad-shown
wait 500
quit

=== again
wait 4000
mark o-pad-still-docked
wait 500
quit
